<view class="page-shell about-page">
  <view class="section-kicker">GOVERNED BY DESIGN</view>
  <view class="page-heading">隐私与产品边界</view>
  <view class="page-copy">当前版本已打通导入、确认、决策、证据、提醒预览、地图提案和隐私控制；实时商业数据按来源逐项配置。</view>

  <view class="panel boundary-card">
    <view class="boundary-item">
      <view class="item-mark allowed">✓</view>
      <view>
        <view class="item-title">当前可以做</view>
        <view class="item-copy">导入短信/ICS/截图、确认行程、融合机场/路线/天气/事件上下文、计算出发建议、预览提醒并生成官方地图提案。</view>
      </view>
    </view>
    <view class="boundary-item">
      <view class="item-mark blocked">×</view>
      <view>
        <view class="item-title">当前不会做</view>
        <view class="item-copy">逆向读取其他 App、绕过用户同意发送精确位置、把模型输出当作事实、自动预约或付款。</view>
      </view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="policy-title">数据处理原则</view>
  <view class="policy-list">
    <view class="policy-item">
      <view class="policy-index">01</view>
      <view>
        <view class="item-title">最小必要</view>
        <view class="item-copy">解析前遮盖姓名、手机号、票号、订单号和证件信息；精确坐标仅在用户明确同意后用于本次算路。</view>
      </view>
    </view>
    <view class="policy-item">
      <view class="policy-index">02</view>
      <view>
        <view class="item-title">不持久化行程</view>
        <view class="item-copy">编辑内容只保留在小程序运行内存；服务端为无状态预览，不写入业务数据库。</view>
      </view>
    </view>
    <view class="policy-item">
      <view class="policy-index">03</view>
      <view>
        <view class="item-title">确定性决策</view>
        <view class="item-copy">出发时间由版本化规则计算并经 Verifier 核验，模型不能自由改写时间。</view>
      </view>
    </view>
    <view class="policy-item">
      <view class="policy-index">04</view>
      <view>
        <view class="item-title">逐项授权</view>
        <view class="item-copy">位置、模型解释、微信订阅和外部地图操作分别说明目的，并由用户明确授权或再次确认。</view>
      </view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="website-card">
    <view class="website-label">网页版与项目说明</view>
    <view class="website-url">{{website}}</view>
    <button class="ghost-button copy-button" bindtap="copyWebsite">复制网站地址</button>
  </view>

  <view class="legal-note">本页面是工程隐私说明，不替代正式上线前的微信小程序隐私保护指引、用户协议或法律评估。</view>
</view>
